# Nothing is required for local dev by default — the frontend has no auth
# config of its own (Roadmap Phase 10's login flow lives entirely in the Go
# backend: internal/authn, see AGENTS.md's "Authentication (Phase 10)" and
# "Rendering model" sections). Copy to .env.local only if you need to
# override where the frontend calls the backend.

# Defaults to http://localhost:8080 (see lib/api/config.ts). Set to "" to
# make it relative instead, for a same-origin deployment where one server
# (the Go backend) serves both the API and this static export.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=
